shuttle-curse-not-cultist = The sphere slips from your hands.
shuttle-curse-shuttle-not-called = The sphere conveys to you that the shuttle has not been called.
shuttle-curse-max-curses = The sphere conveys that the shuttle cannot be cursed any further.
shuttle-curse-cooldown = The sphere conveys that it needs to gather its strength for the curse.
shuttle-curse-shuttle-arrived = The sphere conveys that it is already too late.
shuttle-curse-shuttle-delayed = The sphere conveys that the curse has been cast.
